cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to MoobFS in research, please cite it as below."
title: "MoobFS: an experimental native Linux filesystem layer for LLM-agent memory"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Studio Moob"
    website: "https://github.com/studiomoob"
repository-code: "https://github.com/studiomoob/llmoobfs"
url: "https://studiomoob.github.io/llmoobfs/"
license: GPL-2.0-only
version: "v0.1.0-experimental"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
abstract: >-
  Experimental Linux kernel module (no FUSE): a stacked filesystem layer over
  ext4, btrfs or XFS that adds typed extended attributes, an in-memory index and
  a QUERY ioctl whose results are authorized by the caller's POSIX credentials.
  Research project, not for production use.
keywords:
  - linux-kernel
  - filesystem
  - stacked-filesystem
  - extended-attributes
  - metadata-index
  - llm-memory
